# Build and runtime artifacts.
#
# Everything under dist/ and public/ is generated by `npm run build`, and the pages the
# verification suites write into dist/ embed rows from fixture/ (real exports). Ignoring
# the whole folder is simpler than listing the pages, and safer: a suite added later
# cannot leak real data by being forgotten here.
dist/
public/

# Real institutional data - never commit.
#
#   fixture/         the real .xls exports (asset registers + staff names)
#   contoh-output/   a real merged 536-asset list, despite the "Contoh" in its name
#   docs/*.png       screenshots of the real list, where staff names are legible
#   data/            durable records exported from D1
#
# NOTE: src/App.tsx carries a five-row DEMO dataset and tests/run-tests.mjs hard-codes a
# few expectations quoted from the fixture. Those are staff names as well. They are here
# because the demo button needs rows to show; replace them with fictional ones before
# making this repository public.
fixture/
contoh-output/
docs/*.png
data/

# wrangler and its local scratch state
node_modules/
.wrangler/
cloudflare/node_modules/
cloudflare/.wrangler/
cloudflare/package-lock.json